d82fe5ba" target="_self" class="css-12a4zbu e1yv2nyc5" href="/blog/seven-habits-of-highly-effective-ai-coding/"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1120px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/1bd0b9ad-f3c8-46bd-b278-a7ac8d3d155b/seven%20habits_blog-index-2.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/1bd0b9ad-f3c8-46bd-b278-a7ac8d3d155b/seven%20habits_blog-index-2.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="352" height="217"/><source media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/1bd0b9ad-f3c8-46bd-b278-a7ac8d3d155b/seven%20habits_blog-index-2.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/1bd0b9ad-f3c8-46bd-b278-a7ac8d3d155b/seven%20habits_blog-index-2.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="720" height="443"/><source srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/1bd0b9ad-f3c8-46bd-b278-a7ac8d3d155b/seven%20habits_blog-index-2.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/1bd0b9ad-f3c8-46bd-b278-a7ac8d3d155b/seven%20habits_blog-index-2.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="500" height="307.69"/><img src="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/1bd0b9ad-f3c8-46bd-b278-a7ac8d3d155b/seven%20habits_blog-index-2.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70" class="css-16xa7li e1yv2nyc0" alt="Image for Seven Habits of Highly Effective AI Coding" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="500" height="307.69"/></picture><div class="css-to5i01 e1yv2nyc1"><span class="css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc6">Blog post</span><h3 class="css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc4">Seven Habits of Highly Effective AI Coding</h3><p class="css-dz64uc e1yv2nyc3">Massive codebases can hugely benefit from developers using AI coding tools, but they must be harnessed in a responsible way. Sonar CEO, Tariq Shaukat, shares what coding &quot;habits&quot; organizations should adopt.</p><p class="css-53zlin e1yv2nyc2">Read article &gt;</p></div></a><a data-codename="card-baf35a43-e1ab-4c77-914c-2431caa7b798" target="_self" class="css-12a4zbu e1yv2nyc5" href="/blog/data-in-danger-detecting-xss-in-grafana-cve-2025-2703/"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1120px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bce99396-2a51-4fdd-85bb-151bf7af1c3d/Data%20in%20Danger_blog-index.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bce99396-2a51-4fdd-85bb-151bf7af1c3d/Data%20in%20Danger_blog-index.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="352" height="217"/><source media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bce99396-2a51-4fdd-85bb-151bf7af1c3d/Data%20in%20Danger_blog-index.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bce99396-2a51-4fdd-85bb-151bf7af1c3d/Data%20in%20Danger_blog-index.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="720" height="443"/><source srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bce99396-2a51-4fdd-85bb-151bf7af1c3d/Data%20in%20Danger_blog-index.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bce99396-2a51-4fdd-85bb-151bf7af1c3d/Data%20in%20Danger_blog-index.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="500" height="307.69"/><img src="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bce99396-2a51-4fdd-85bb-151bf7af1c3d/Data%20in%20Danger_blog-index.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70" class="css-16xa7li e1yv2nyc0" alt="Image for Data in Danger: Detecting Cross-Site Scripting in Grafana" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="500" height="307.69"/></picture><div class="css-to5i01 e1yv2nyc1"><span class="css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc6">Blog post</span><h3 class="css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc4">Data in Danger: Detecting Cross-Site Scripting in Grafana</h3><p class="css-dz64uc e1yv2nyc3">Learn how SonarQube detected a Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability in Grafana, a popular open-source data observability platform.</p><p class="css-53zlin e1yv2nyc2">Read article &gt;</p></div></a><a data-codename="card-a84a939b-380f-43ca-917e-976e3e63ba4e" target="_self" class="css-12a4zbu e1yv2nyc5" href="/blog/introducing-rust-in-sonarqube/"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1120px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bf290995-18d3-4b26-9805-a3e2a848882a/rust%20language_landscape-index.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bf290995-18d3-4b26-9805-a3e2a848882a/rust%20language_landscape-index.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="352" height="217"/><source media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bf290995-18d3-4b26-9805-a3e2a848882a/rust%20language_landscape-index.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bf290995-18d3-4b26-9805-a3e2a848882a/rust%20language_landscape-index.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="720" height="443"/><source srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bf290995-18d3-4b26-9805-a3e2a848882a/rust%20language_landscape-index.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bf290995-18d3-4b26-9805-a3e2a848882a/rust%20language_landscape-index.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="500" height="307.69"/><img src="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/bf290995-18d3-4b26-9805-a3e2a848882a/rust%20language_landscape-index.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70" class="css-16xa7li e1yv2nyc0" alt="Image for Introducing support for Rust in SonarQube" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="500" height="307.69"/></picture><div class="css-to5i01 e1yv2nyc1"><span class="css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc6">Blog post</span><h3 class="css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc4">Introducing support for Rust in SonarQube</h3><p class="css-dz64uc e1yv2nyc3">The popularity of the Rust programming language is growing. Rustaceans have been asking for SonarQube to support Rust and now it&#x27;s here!</p><p class="css-53zlin e1yv2nyc2">Read article &gt;</p></div></a><a data-codename="card-c48011a0-0122-4baa-b880-19556c54e940" target="_self" class="css-12a4zbu e1yv2nyc5" href="/blog/misra-c-plus-plus-compliance-early-access/"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1120px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/9ddd0700-5d93-49d6-aa91-571ffe60b56e/MISRA%20Compliance_blog-feature.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/9ddd0700-5d93-49d6-aa91-571ffe60b56e/MISRA%20Compliance_blog-feature.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="352" height="217"/><source media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/9ddd0700-5d93-49d6-aa91-571ffe60b56e/MISRA%20Compliance_blog-feature.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/9ddd0700-5d93-49d6-aa91-571ffe60b56e/MISRA%20Compliance_blog-feature.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="720" height="443"/><source srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/9ddd0700-5d93-49d6-aa91-571ffe60b56e/MISRA%20Compliance_blog-feature.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/9ddd0700-5d93-49d6-aa91-571ffe60b56e/MISRA%20Compliance_blog-feature.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="500" height="307.69"/><img src="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/9ddd0700-5d93-49d6-aa91-571ffe60b56e/MISRA%20Compliance_blog-feature.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70" class="css-16xa7li e1yv2nyc0" alt="Image for MISRA C++:2023 Compliance for Auto Safety and Reliability" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="500" height="307.69"/></picture><div class="css-to5i01 e1yv2nyc1"><span class="css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc6">Blog post</span><h3 class="css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc4">MISRA C++:2023 Compliance for Auto Safety and Reliability</h3><p class="css-dz64uc e1yv2nyc3">MISRA coding guidelines are a standard for automotive and other safety critical systems. SonarQube helps C++ developers deliver MISRA C++:2023 compliant apps with MISRA Compliance Early Access available in SonarQube Server Enterprise and Data Center.</p><p class="css-53zlin e1yv2nyc2">Read article &gt;</p></div></a><a data-codename="card-de94edc5-b511-4325-9606-f7bc530811b4" target="_self" class="css-12a4zbu e1yv2nyc5" href="/blog/introducing-architecture-as-code-in-sonarqube/"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1120px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/c3fdfb59-31f3-4751-b3a0-a9613c391f65/Architecture%20as%20Code_blog-feature.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/c3fdfb59-31f3-4751-b3a0-a9613c391f65/Architecture%20as%20Code_blog-feature.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="352" height="217"/><source media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/c3fdfb59-31f3-4751-b3a0-a9613c391f65/Architecture%20as%20Code_blog-feature.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/c3fdfb59-31f3-4751-b3a0-a9613c391f65/Architecture%20as%20Code_blog-feature.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="720" height="443"/><source srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/c3fdfb59-31f3-4751-b3a0-a9613c391f65/Architecture%20as%20Code_blog-feature.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/c3fdfb59-31f3-4751-b3a0-a9613c391f65/Architecture%20as%20Code_blog-feature.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="500" height="307.69"/><img src="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/c3fdfb59-31f3-4751-b3a0-a9613c391f65/Architecture%20as%20Code_blog-feature.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70" class="css-16xa7li e1yv2nyc0" alt="Image for New! Architecture as Code in SonarQube" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="500" height="307.69"/></picture><div class="css-to5i01 e1yv2nyc1"><span class="css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc6">Blog post</span><h3 class="css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc4">New! Architecture as Code in SonarQube</h3><p class="css-dz64uc e1yv2nyc3">Sonar recently introduced new architecture as code functionality in SonarQube. You can now formally define the architecture of your projects and SonarQube will automatically verify when code strays from your defined architecture preventing architectural drift.</p><p class="css-53zlin e1yv2nyc2">Read article &gt;</p></div></a><a data-codename="card-ab0861ad-91f9-44d4-b596-18b366ad1be4" target="_self" class="css-12a4zbu e1yv2nyc5" href="/blog/new-spring-framework-rules-in-sonarqube/"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1120px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/863d3d5c-b4dc-4e8f-90a3-3a1730b94513/New%20Spring%20framework%20rules_Blog-featured-3.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/863d3d5c-b4dc-4e8f-90a3-3a1730b94513/New%20Spring%20framework%20rules_Blog-featured-3.png?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="352" height="217"/><source media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/863d3d5c-b4dc-4e8f-90a3-3a1730b94513/New%20Spring%20framework%20rules_Blog-featured-3.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/863d3d5c-b4dc-4e8f-90a3-3a1730b94513/New%20Spring%20framework%20rules_Blog-featured-3.png?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="720" height="443"/><source srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/863d3d5c-b4dc-4e8f-90a3-3a1730b94513/New%20Spring%20framework%20rules_Blog-featured-3.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/863d3d5c-b4dc-4e8f-90a3-3a1730b94513/New%20Spring%20framework%20rules_Blog-featured-3.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="500" height="307.69"/><img src="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/863d3d5c-b4dc-4e8f-90a3-3a1730b94513/New%20Spring%20framework%20rules_Blog-featured-3.png?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70" class="css-16xa7li e1yv2nyc0" alt="Image for New Spring framework rules in SonarQube" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="500" height="307.69"/></picture><div class="css-to5i01 e1yv2nyc1"><span class="css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc6">Blog post</span><h3 class="css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc4">New Spring framework rules in SonarQube</h3><p class="css-dz64uc e1yv2nyc3">SonarQube has introduced new rules to improve code quality and enforce best practices in Spring Framework applications. These rules focus on various aspects of Spring development, including event handling, scheduling, data and MVC, caching, dependency injection, and testing.</p><p class="css-53zlin e1yv2nyc2">Read article &gt;</p></div></a><a data-codename="card-79305b31-bfe9-47d9-9d4f-3c0098975550" target="_self" class="css-12a4zbu e1yv2nyc5" href="/blog/sonarqube-server-2025-release-2-announcement/"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1120px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/fd1c91ad-9f9b-420f-b6cc-6d6b9cdeef1b/release_2025_2_whats_new_index.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/fd1c91ad-9f9b-420f-b6cc-6d6b9cdeef1b/release_2025_2_whats_new_index.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="352" height="217"/><source media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/fd1c91ad-9f9b-420f-b6cc-6d6b9cdeef1b/release_2025_2_whats_new_index.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/fd1c91ad-9f9b-420f-b6cc-6d6b9cdeef1b/release_2025_2_whats_new_index.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="720" height="443"/><source srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/fd1c91ad-9f9b-420f-b6cc-6d6b9cdeef1b/release_2025_2_whats_new_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/fd1c91ad-9f9b-420f-b6cc-6d6b9cdeef1b/release_2025_2_whats_new_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="500" height="307.69"/><img src="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/fd1c91ad-9f9b-420f-b6cc-6d6b9cdeef1b/release_2025_2_whats_new_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70" class="css-16xa7li e1yv2nyc0" alt="Image for SonarQube Server 2025 Release 2 Announcement" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="500" height="307.69"/></picture><div class="css-to5i01 e1yv2nyc1"><span class="css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc6">Blog post</span><h3 class="css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc4">SonarQube Server 2025 Release 2 Announcement</h3><p class="css-dz64uc e1yv2nyc3">The new SonarQube Server 2025 Release 2 contains significant enhancements across code quality, code security, and issue remediation with AI CodeFix. Read on to learn more about these great new capabilities.
</p><p class="css-53zlin e1yv2nyc2">Read article &gt;</p></div></a><a data-codename="card-5457fde8-2e21-4253-ae05-5e59b82e9c8c" target="_self" class="css-12a4zbu e1yv2nyc5" href="/blog/diving-into-jumpserver-attackers-gateway-to-internal-networks-2-2/"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1120px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/6b38f6ba-9c5a-409f-aa5f-524e74a94cad/jumpserver_02_blog_index.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/6b38f6ba-9c5a-409f-aa5f-524e74a94cad/jumpserver_02_blog_index.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="352" height="217"/><source media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/6b38f6ba-9c5a-409f-aa5f-524e74a94cad/jumpserver_02_blog_index.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/6b38f6ba-9c5a-409f-aa5f-524e74a94cad/jumpserver_02_blog_index.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="720" height="443"/><source srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/6b38f6ba-9c5a-409f-aa5f-524e74a94cad/jumpserver_02_blog_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/6b38f6ba-9c5a-409f-aa5f-524e74a94cad/jumpserver_02_blog_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="500" height="307.69"/><img src="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/6b38f6ba-9c5a-409f-aa5f-524e74a94cad/jumpserver_02_blog_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70" class="css-16xa7li e1yv2nyc0" alt="Image for Diving Into JumpServer: Attacker’s Gateway to Internal Networks (2/2)" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="500" height="307.69"/></picture><div class="css-to5i01 e1yv2nyc1"><span class="css-4tlw9v e1yv2nyc6">Blog post</span><h3 class="css-fjv57c e1yv2nyc4">Diving Into JumpServer: Attacker’s Gateway to Internal Networks (2/2)</h3><p class="css-dz64uc e1yv2nyc3">In this second part, we delve into JumpServer&#x27;s code execution vulnerabilities we discovered, and understand their root causes. Learn the importance of threat modeling and adherence to best practices can safeguard your own applications.</p><p class="css-53zlin e1yv2nyc2">Read article &gt;</p></div></a><a data-codename="card-11ea85ca-dc26-49f9-929a-e3e62cb6a0d4" target="_self" class="css-12a4zbu e1yv2nyc5" href="/blog/diving-into-jumpserver-attackers-gateway-to-internal-networks-1-2/"><picture><source media="(min-width: 1120px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/0eeac4a5-4cd6-49dc-b5ad-1302f83432a0/jumpserver_blog_index.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/0eeac4a5-4cd6-49dc-b5ad-1302f83432a0/jumpserver_blog_index.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="352" height="217"/><source media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/0eeac4a5-4cd6-49dc-b5ad-1302f83432a0/jumpserver_blog_index.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/0eeac4a5-4cd6-49dc-b5ad-1302f83432a0/jumpserver_blog_index.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x" width="720" height="443"/><source srcSet="https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/0eeac4a5-4cd6-49dc-b5ad-1302f83432a0/jumpserver_blog_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/5dddefee-e8bb-013a-3b4e-7907971cf825/0eeac4a5-4